    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0d463f5d88c14430bfecc83ada40bb68",
      "statement": "The mobile half of app-e2e is gated by a `mobile` path filter that must remain a strict subset of the job's `app` filter, plus a `mobile-e2e` PR label override; on a pull_request that matches neither, the job still runs the web E2E and integration tiers but skips the ~35-minute emulator half.",
      "evidence": [
